%% Updated: 2026-06-26.
%% Purpose: Show how organizer views ranked proposal list and triages contributors.
%% Excludes: Proposal submit flow, withdraw flow, approval/rejection side effects.
%% Related: act_02b_marketplace_apply.mmd — proposal happy path; act_02e_marketplace_application_exceptions.mmd — exception paths.
%% Reader intent: Understand how organizer sees ranked proposals and what factors shape that ranking.
%% Key boundary: Covers ranking/triage only, not proposal submit/withdraw side effects or approval outcome handling.
%% Current caveat: Formula weights reflect current runtime logic and can change independently from UI labels.

flowchart TD
    Start(["Organizer opens task proposal page"]) --> FetchRanking["GET /api/v1/tasks/:taskId/applications/ranking
    → GetMarketplaceTaskApplicationsRankingQuery"]

    FetchRanking --> LoadTask["Load task context:
    business_domain, problem_category, task_type, project_id"]
    LoadTask --> LoadApps["Load pending + approved proposals
    with contributor + trust_data"]

    LoadTask --> LoadSkills["Load task_required_skills
    (required_level, is_mandatory, weight, importance)"]

    LoadApps --> Loop["For each contributor:"]
    LoadSkills --> Loop

    Loop --> CalcSkill["Skill Match:
    • Level ratio (user vs required)
    • Source weight (reviewed = 1.0, imported = 0.5)
    • Importance multiplier (critical = 1.5, high = 1.25, low = 0.75)
    • Weight factor"]

    Loop --> CalcDomain["Domain Match:
    • business_domain match = 25 pts
    • problem_category match = 15 pts
    • task_type match = 10 pts
    • Cap at 100"]

    Loop --> CalcDelivery["Delivery Reliability:
    • on-time ratio from work_history
    • Percentage"]

    Loop --> CalcTrust["Trust Score:
    • From user.trust_data.calculated_score
    • Clamped 0-100"]

    CalcSkill --> Overall["Overall = skill*0.4 + domain*0.2 + delivery*0.2 + trust*0.2"]
    CalcDomain --> Overall
    CalcDelivery --> Overall
    CalcTrust --> Overall

    Overall --> FitLabel{"Fit label:"}
    FitLabel -->|>= 80| Strong["strong_match"]
    FitLabel -->|>= 60| Good["good_match"]
    FitLabel -->|>= 40| Partial["partial_match"]
    FitLabel -->|< 40| Weak["weak_match"]

    Strong --> SourceCheck["Contributor source:"]
    Good --> SourceCheck
    Partial --> SourceCheck
    Weak --> SourceCheck

    SourceCheck -->|project_member| SourcePM["project_member"]
    SourceCheck -->|org_member| SourceOrg["org_member"]
    SourceCheck -->|neither| SourceExt["external"]

    SourcePM --> Sort["Sort by match_score DESC"]
    SourceOrg --> Sort
    SourceExt --> Sort

    Sort --> Render["UI renders:
    • Ranked list with scores
    • Fit label badge
    • Contributor source badge
    • Skill overlap details
    • Risks + explanations"]

    Render --> OrganizerDecision["Organizer selects contributor proposal for approval"]

